        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-6cc062915871",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "In the morning, take a sightseeing tour of the city lasting about 4 hours. The route introduces you to several sides of Buenos Aires, from historic San Telmo and the port district of La Boca to Recoleta with its famous cemetery, modern Puerto Madero and the Retiro district.\n\nYou’ll see the Teatro Colón, Plaza de Mayo, Avenida de Mayo, the National Congress and other historic and cultural sites. The city’s history is visible in its streets, from waves of immigration and the affluent neighbourhoods of the late 19th and early 20th centuries to life around the port and the emergence of tango."
    },
